  "value": {
   "reference": "simulate day by day on a copy of the grid, counting the 8 neighbours of every healthy plant each day, until a day infects nothing",
   "candidate_design": "multi-source breadth-first search by days: keep for every healthy plant the number of infected neighbours; when a plant is infected on day d, add one to each healthy neighbour and put a neighbour that reaches threshold into the day d + 1 frontier; the answer is the last infection day if every plant was reached, else -1",
   "complexity_target": "O(m * n) time/O(m * n) space"
